  "reasoning": "The facts describe two distinct criminal conduct: (1) the defendant stole cash (2100元) from a victim’s bag, which constitutes the crime of theft (盗窃). (2) The defendant purchased and concealed a replica 64‑type pistol, which under Chinese law is treated as a firearm; possessing it without a license is the crime of illegal possession of a gun (非法持有、私藏枪支、弹药). Both offenses are supported by the evidence and the defendant did not dispute them. Therefore the appropriate charges are theft and illegal possession of a firearm.",
